<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gillette upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gillette upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Goldman Sachs raised its recommendation on Gillette Co to recommended from market perform, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Gillette shares rose 1-3/8 to 67-3/8.</p>
</text>
